{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a85a6869f1b9b2a50006bf4b155e31a935df0c67752c0064ef2b5690c7a00d69", "ja": "（『リリィ・ナイトと天空の騎士団』の撮影が\nもうすぐ始まる。さて、星梨花の様子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（《莉莉骑士与天空骑士团》的拍摄马上就要开始了。那么，星梨花现在怎么样了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "98710f6bd2d80a5a2afb698b40d0ce2a70edaf062b881f64a9b005d939bfecd9", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　お疲れさまです。\nあの、聞きたいことがあるんですけど……いいですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！辛苦了。\n那个，我有件事想问您……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "71f29222fd71cc3cb50ad49ad0302c53a12e7587f1699a3e7ad4bcd9634c7c52", "ja": "お疲れさま、星梨花。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "2869c217edc34786224cb12d66fe8b5bf97bd1cb578f56a88afcb8c11505090c", "ja": "えっと。{$P$}さんも、\n体が小さかったことがあるんですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生以前身体也很小吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aab519cb00a9386d592751d1d23361378524b245134a4651a3312598a9f6b8c1", "ja": "え？　まあ、子供の頃は小さかったかもな。\nでも、どうしてそんなことを？", "zh": "咦？嗯，我小时候可能确实比较矮吧。\n不过，你为什么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "5b8f101d66981b63b528d36560473556720809e248cad3aa222697ab60a9531b", "ja": "はい。わたし、映画の中では小さな妖精さんです。\n本当はもっともっと体が小さいはずなんですけど……。", "zh": "是的。在电影里，我是一位小小的妖精。\n其实我的身体应该还要更小更小才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "452285411361b23c5af51a0c70ab6f91eecbd3db1afc6ef18dd26ea92a6aa526", "ja": "でも今のわたしは人間です。妖精さんの見る景色は、\n人間とは違う世界が見えると思うんです。", "zh": "但是现在的我是人类。我觉得，妖精所看到的景色，应该是和人类不同的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "f09ef42ab2cd4c9761003aefd6816cf1dbdf355227cbe34458285192df6840b1", "ja": "わたし、この役をちゃんとやりたいんですけど、\n妖精さんの気持ちがわからなくて……。", "zh": "我想好好演绎这个角色，可是……我不明白妖精的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a64d8ecd637e1a2319cd99e15d985a455ad1abf4b164106c4a4437ac78e6c36f", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで、小さい頃の話を聞きたかったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以，你才想听听我小时候的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "1647d7fdc430d394f5e01cb747650c66fde6808d3220a8d57fdc0b0832478c4f", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんは、\n子どもの時のことって覚えていますか？", "zh": "是的。{$P$}先生，您还记得小时候的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5979885ff25a21bed77b142bb82b52d31118a6383c53927e52ad0843e6eb434d", "ja": "うーん、そんなに覚えてないかな。でも、\n妖精の視点を想像するのは少し難しいよな……。", "zh": "嗯……不太记得了。不过，要想象妖精的视角，还是有点难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "89415b486fe530cba03337df507dc0a3dc38485c1c22cc16dade3a854bb7bac4", "ja": "よし。ちょっと監督に相談してみようか。\nもしかしたら、何かいい案をくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "好。我去和导演商量一下吧。\n说不定，他能给出什么好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "4bc519a04c09910e2c3db609ae18600ef2d72178144b51b0d3fdf79e5d141570", "ja": "わぁ～！　見てください！\n画面の中で、わたし、ちいさな妖精さんになってます！", "zh": "哇～！快看！\n在画面里，我变成小小的妖精了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f06349256a0ba60527f52998285a598f68148cae2fdcb574dcf3359db3888c8", "ja": "なんだか映画の世界に入っちゃったみたい……。\n{$P$}さん、すごいです！", "zh": "总觉得……好像进入电影的世界了……。{$P$}先生，太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e8b892a0842f97775de7014c7750ad4d37f23922150e7de9614a83ba883a2ccf", "ja": "ありがとう。監督に話したら、妖精のサイズ感を\n試してみたいって言ってくれてね。", "zh": "谢谢。我跟导演提了一下之后，导演就说想试试看妖精的体型尺寸呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "93a21c1be155d14bdbddd21bd84f6c2ec5d3743eb4a454c4edea3462ad76e0ec", "ja": "そうだったんですね！　周りの物がすごく大きくて……\nこれが、妖精さんの見ている景色なんですね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊！周围的东西都好大……\n这就是小精灵看到的景色啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "1cfd1d6283c10f4854c38ed2d6f12632957e5edc527a40bbc74a54d9ea6c571b", "ja": "でも大きすぎて、ぶつかったらすごく痛そう……。\nあっ。妖精さんは、人間よりも危険がいっぱいなんだ。", "zh": "但是太大了，要是撞上去肯定会很痛……\n啊。对妖精来说，比人类要危险得多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4e2fd764a513d4f2c0aa8c79bfb941e39f144f58f871a97cf510429169f83133", "ja": "どうだ、星梨花？　映像の中だけだったけど、\n妖精の気持ちはつかめそうか？", "zh": "怎么样，星梨花？虽然只是在影像里，你能理解妖精的心情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "20343c85e11fd3b047d59b7cc7dbc57ff378155bd955f611e6011431579dbac0", "ja": "はい、ちょっとだけわかった気がします！\n妖精さんは、とっても広い世界を見てるんだって。", "zh": "嗯，我好像稍微明白了一点！\n精灵们看到的是一个非常广阔的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "d793c2bb60bdd022d1c79d3778f4636ffdf97ded47cb23bab9107e488443ecaf", "ja": "この気持ちを忘れないように、撮影がんばりますね。\nみなさんと冒険するのが、楽しみです♪　えへへ。", "zh": "为了不忘记这份心情，我会努力拍摄的。\n期待和大家一起冒险♪ 嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0244_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9e9ef0c59fe1ac0fde9054fec44bbce6b5b537c54746ea181d00f186cce636e1", "ja": "（具体的にイメージすることで、うまく役に向き合えた\nみたいだ。その調子で本番も頑張ろうな、星梨花！）", "zh": "（通过具体想象，似乎终于能顺利面对这个角色了。\n就照这个状态，在正式拍摄时也加油吧，星梨花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
